---
metadata: {
    partial_name: "Event | Log event",
}
---
{%- comment -%}
  Adds an entry to the instance's event stream. Run it as a background job, so the page
  does not wait for it:
    background logged = 'events/log_event', description: 'New Registration', log: log
  description: a short line shown in the event stream.
  log: a hash of details. details, font_icon and font_icon_color are optional.
  It calls the CRM module's event stream controller in the same request, so no API key
  is sent anywhere by this app. The controller is a path alias inside the installed CRM
  module, which the linter cannot see, hence the disable comment.
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- liquid
  assign event = {}
  assign event['description'] = description | default: ''
  assign event['details'] = details | default: ''
  assign event['font_icon'] = font_icon | default: 'icon-info'
  assign event['font_icon_color'] = font_icon_color | default: '#451278'
  assign event['log'] = log | default: null
-%}
{%- comment -%}insites-check-disable-next-line MissingPartial{%- endcomment -%}
{%- function added = 'crm/controller/event-streams/create', params: event -%}
